JWT Token :-

	JWT is a open source standard used to share information between client-server application
	By Using JWT ,we will generate token/validate Tokens
	NOTE:- By Default spring boot not providing any JWT libraries
	
	JWT token contains 3 sections
		1. Header:- By using which algorithm we are generating token
		2. Payload:- Information of clients
		3. Signature:- sign in with secret key
		
		Header+payload+signature(security Key)
	
